\" t
.TH MUNIPACK  1 "June 2013" "Munipack" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
munipack \- command line interface for Munipack
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B munipack
.I [options] action file(s)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Munipack is a general astronomical image processing software.
This utility provides the command line interface for
all features of Munipack.
.PP
The detailed description is very extensible and can be found
in HTML documentation. There are summarized just help related options.
A short help list is build-in.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Print this help. Try with a selected action.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version and license.
